<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hadco cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hadco cut to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Sons said on Wednesday it had cut its rating for Hadco Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Salem, N.H., maker of electronic interconnect products closed on Tuesday at 54-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
